   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "MINTED by the first TRUSTED SERVICE\n\nUsed when the original client cannot (e.g. a\nlegacy sender). That service becomes the origin\nand MUST persist the key before the first\ndownstream attempt.",
