   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "GENERATED by an SDK\n\nMints at the call site and reuses it across its\ninternal retries. Must ALSO let callers supply\ntheir own key (needed when the retry happens\nafter a process restart).",
