   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Roughly APPEND-ordered: better index locality.\nBut it reveals creation time and relies on a client clock: never treat the time\npart as truth.",
   "originalText": "Roughly APPEND-ordered: better index locality.\nBut it reveals creation time and relies on a client clock: never treat the time\npart as truth.",
