   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "EventPulse event_id sits in a unique index, so locality is a real throughput factor on large tables: MEASURE before deciding.\nCorrectness is identical for both.",
   "originalText": "EventPulse event_id sits in a unique index, so locality is a real throughput factor on large tables: MEASURE before deciding.\nCorrectness is identical for both.",
