   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "The key means 'this is the SAME logical request'. So a different body means the client either\n(a) reused a key by mistake (two different events share an id), or  (b) changed the request on purpose but forgot to change the key.",
   "originalText": "The key means 'this is the SAME logical request'. So a different body means the client either\n(a) reused a key by mistake (two different events share an id), or  (b) changed the request on purpose but forgot to change the key.",
