   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "1. REPLAY THE ORIGINAL, do not recompute\nIf the first answer was a 202 with a body, replay it. Recomputing may\ngive different data (e.g. a later timestamp).",
   "originalText": "1. REPLAY THE ORIGINAL, do not recompute\nIf the first answer was a 202 with a body, replay it. Recomputing may\ngive different data (e.g. a later timestamp).",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d15_0076",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d15_0078",
