   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Two spellings: (a) locked_until stored INSIDE a long-TTL record: takeover compares and swaps, hash is kept.\n(b) short Redis TTL on the IN_PROGRESS value: the key just disappears (-> absent) and the next request claims afresh, with no old hash to compare.",
   "originalText": "Two spellings: (a) locked_until stored INSIDE a long-TTL record: takeover compares and swaps, hash is kept.\n(b) short Redis TTL on the IN_PROGRESS value: the key just disappears (-> absent) and the next request claims afresh, with no old hash to compare.",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d17_0053",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
