   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "One key or two? If both are sent they must agree, or the API\ndefines precedence. SIMPLEST: event_id IS the key for POST\n/events (no extra header); batches dedup per item. A separate\nheader suits non-event endpoints (config changes) with no natural\nid.",
   "originalText": "One key or two? If both are sent they must agree, or the API\ndefines precedence. SIMPLEST: event_id IS the key for POST\n/events (no extra header); batches dedup per item. A separate\nheader suits non-event endpoints (config changes) with no natural\nid.",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d21_0005",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
